# ICDA License

ICDA is licensed under the **PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0**
plus the **ICDA Additional Terms** below. Together they mean:

- You MAY use, modify, fork, and share ICDA for any **noncommercial** purpose.
- You MAY NOT sell ICDA, sell copies or derivatives of it, or use it
  commercially without a separate commercial license from the licensor.
- You MAY NOT market or present ICDA (or any modified version of it) as a
  different product. Forks must make clear they derive from ICDA.
- You MUST give credit to the ICDA project, even for minimally changed forks.

```
Required Notice: Copyright ICDA Project (https://github.com/elabbas/ICDA)
```

